<title>ARGENTINA: Telefonica Argentina leaves Startel.</title>
<headline>Telefonica Argentina leaves Startel.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telefonica de Argentina said Monday it was pulling out of data transmission company Startel SA, a joint venture it had with Telecom Argentina.</p>
<p>A statement from the company gave no other details.</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom 541 318-0657))</p>
</text>
